   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United against torture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The mission of &quot;En Vero&quot; is to eradicate torture in all its forms, promoting and protecting fundamental human rights around the world, since its inception we are committed to fight tirelessly to eliminate suffering and abuse, regardless of race, gender, religion or social status, we work to raise awareness in society about the seriousness of torture and its devastating effects on victims and their families. Our commitment is to work to create a world where torture is an eradicated practice.</narrative>
